WEBVTT

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:08.430
This video shows how to set up a salary structure on your phone. Each staff member needs one before payroll can be run.

00:00:10.101 --> 00:00:21.813
Tap the menu button at the top left, open HR and Staff, and choose Salary. The page shows the payroll totals and a card for each staff member who already has a structure.

00:00:24.788 --> 00:00:30.572
Tap Add Salary Structure at the top of the page. A form opens.

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:35.998
Tap Select Staff and choose the staff member, here Ali Khan.

00:00:37.409 --> 00:00:42.497
Tap the Basic Salary box and enter the amount, here 50000.

00:00:44.047 --> 00:00:57.847
Tap Add next to Allowances and enter a name and an amount, here house rent, 8000. Then tap Add next to Deductions and enter tax, 1500. A summary shows the net salary.

00:01:04.668 --> 00:01:08.772
In Effective From, enter the date the salary starts from.

00:01:16.753 --> 00:01:27.337
Tap Create. A message says the salary structure was created, the form closes, and Ali Khan now has a card in the list with his basic and net pay.

00:01:38.553 --> 00:01:44.001
The salary structure is saved, so payroll can now be run for this staff member.
